    'body' => <<<'HTML'
<div class="key-takeaways"><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul>
<li>After a fire you may deal with three kinds of adjusters: staff and independent adjusters work for the insurer; a public adjuster works for you.</li>
<li>A fire claim is rarely just burned materials. Smoke and soot, firefighting water, HVAC contamination, contents, debris removal, and living expenses all matter.</li>
<li>Photograph everything before cleanup and keep damaged items until the insurer says you can dispose of them.</li>
<li>Replacement cost and actual cash value can produce very different payments, so know which applies to each part of your policy.</li>
